Z||000000||danny boy||06-06-2001||11:54 PM|||| Oh it was awful! Issa's cousin came over today and wanted to know if he could use my garage to adjust his coilovers. I thought about it, Decided I needed to get the GT out to take some work in progress pics and let him in. I can't believe I even let him anywhere near my garage. You see, he drives a Honda.Even worse, its a CRX.And it was in my garage.even worse than that, my GT sat in the yard and it started raining. Honda-EEEW!<BR><P>------------------<BR>don't push the A/c button.. it catches the car on fire      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
